  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Copenhagen Gl\u00f8d Index Close No. Section 01 Home 02 Menus 03 Events 04 Private dining 05 Story No. Section 06 Journal 07 Gift cards 08 Visit 09 Book a table 10 All pages Find us J\u00e6gersborggade 41, 2200 K\u00f8benhavn N Open Wednesday to Saturday, 17:30 to 23:00 Talk to us [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 Private dining Baglokalet The back room, with one long oak table, sheepskins on the benches and its own door to the street. Plan an event Plan an event About the room About the room Seated Up to 24 Standing Up to 35 Minimum spend 15.000 kr Menu Written by Freja The room Baglokalet was a bicycle workshop before it was ours. We kept the brick, whitewashed it, and built one oak table long enough for twenty-four. It has its own door to J\u00e6gersborggade, so your guests can come and go without walking through the restaurant, and a small bar in the corner where we pour the first glass. The menu Freja writes a menu for the evening from what is in season, served to share down the table. Our sommelier pairs it from the cellar, or you can choose bottles yourself. Good for Birthdays, team dinners, julefrokost and the kind of wedding dinner where everyone ends up singing. Minimum spend",
